/delaware-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, November to December ran 29% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 19641 came in at 45% that year.</p>"}
